/**
 * Verified routes played by hand on the physical puzzle.
 *
 * These are the strongest validation the engine has: a long, real playthrough
 * that the engine reproduces move for move. Every one is asserted in
 * routes.test.mjs, so a change to the gravity model that breaks a real game
 * fails the build.
 *
 * They are also the solver's benchmark. Each is a route a person found that the
 * search currently cannot.
 */

